      "audioUrl": "audio/necro_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo03_01.mp3",
      "text": "I'm able to hold my own.",
      "duration": 1.688
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Seven",
      "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo03_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo03_02.mp3",
      "text": "I never said you couldn't.",
      "duration": 1.84
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Graves",
      "audioFile": "necro_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo03_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/necro_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo03_03.mp3",
      "text": "I know I'm young, but -",
      "duration": 1.457
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Seven",
      "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo03_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo03_04.mp3",
      "text": "I don't care how old you are.  If you're compotent you'll survive, if you're not you'll die - either way you're not my concern.",
